WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.760
Hi, Mr. President.

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:02.840
I'm honored being here today,

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.240
and I first wanted to start by thanking you guys

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.800
for designating Antifa a terrorist group.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.820
It's exactly what this group is.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.000
It's a long time coming.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.120
I'm an investigative journalist from Seattle.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.720
I worked for the Postmillennial alongside Andy Ngo

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:17.280
and Jack Posobiec.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.400
I have been infiltrating Antifa cells

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.120
in Seattle and Portland for the past decade.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.959
I know their inner workings,

00:00:24.959 --> 00:00:27.799
and Antifa uses extreme political violence

00:00:27.799 --> 00:00:30.440
to crush the civil rights of their political enemies

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.799
and believes that violence is justified

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:34.240
by any means necessary.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.919
But today, I want to focus on what is happening

00:00:37.919 --> 00:00:40.119
in Portland at the ICE facility.

00:00:40.119 --> 00:00:43.279
I've been covering this for the past four months,

00:00:43.279 --> 00:00:45.480
and this is a call out to corporate media

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:47.840
who has completely ignored this story

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:50.560
or has falsely reported on it.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:53.919
This is nothing short other than a sustained attack

00:00:53.919 --> 00:00:55.520
on the United States,

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:58.880
which is being supported by Democratic elected officials.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.240
The Portland Police Bureau

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.000
has completely abandoned several blocks

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.519
outside the ICE facility,

00:01:04.519 --> 00:01:08.440
giving away their jurisdiction to a terrorist group

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:10.559
who has spent the past four months harassing,

00:01:10.559 --> 00:01:13.800
assaulting, and intimidating anyone they perceive

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:15.580
to be against their cause.

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:20.320
Not only have federal agents been relentlessly assaulted

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:22.559
for more than 100 consecutive days,

00:01:22.559 --> 00:01:24.559
black clad anarchist militants

00:01:24.559 --> 00:01:28.080
concealing their identities behind black facial coverings

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.800
have been assaulting reporters

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.440
just for trying to cover their crimes.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.720
Today, I am sitting here with a black eye and a concussion

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:40.040
after being violently hit in the face with a metal pole

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:41.839
while reporting outside the ICE facility

00:01:41.839 --> 00:01:43.360
just this past week.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:45.320
After the attack, I immediately went

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:48.080
to three Portland police officers

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:51.000
who refused to detain the suspect.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.820
I took the time to chase down the suspect

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:56.739
in the streets, had her held for 35 minutes.

